    "created_at": "2016-04-22T21:53:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-22T21:53:39Z",
    "body": "@foolip @mounirlamouri do you think that adding promise-returning play() is sufficient here, or should we still consider changing the timing of the `playing` event?\n\nIf we don't want to change the timing, should we consider adding a note near the `playing` event explaining this potential pitfall and saying \"you probably really want to use the promise returned by play()\"?\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
