    "created_at": "2016-04-25T09:50:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-04-25T09:50:47Z",
    "body": "I filed this issue to change the timing of the `playing` event and when the promise is resolved, and I think we should do that. I think that the best way of going about it is to prototype it in an implementation and then from there figure out what the spec language should be.\n",
